From df7d40617141c894040fa31eb59674a6078cd1de Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Claude <noreply@anthropic.com>
Date: Mon, 16 Nov 2026 09:30:28 +0000
Subject: [PATCH] Fix stroke scaling on paper documents; revert geometry to
 centimetres

Reverts the metre migration from 91c7398 (original CompassCAD centimetre geometry, grid,
.ccad/.cnext v1 formats) and keeps the SVG/PDF exporter, ported to centimetres.

Strokes: infinite canvas keeps original behaviour (radius in drawing units); on paper
documents one radius unit is 0.125 mm of paper, so the default radius 2 matches the 0.25 mm
border/title-block rule at any drawing scale. Editor and exporter share documentStrokeScale().
